SDL-E1057 (spec/table.md)

  x table clause value out of domain: an INLINE cache cap cannot exceed 256 — `inline edges: 257;` is out of domain
   ,----
 1 | table t { inline edges: 257; };
   :                         ^|^
   :                          `-- out of this clause's domain
   `----
  help: each `table` clause constrains its own value — the INLINE cache caps take 0–256 (the engine rejects anything larger at define time too)
